# Disk Management & Formatting
lsblk           - Lists disks and partitions
fdisk -l        - Displays disk partition information
parted -l       - Lists disk partition tables
blkid           - Displays filesystem UUIDs and types
fdisk           - Manages disk partitions
parted          - Creates and manages disk partitions
partprobe       - Updates kernel partition information
partx           - Updates partition table information
mkfs            - Creates a filesystem
mkfs.ext4       - Formats a partition with ext4 filesystem
mkfs.xfs        - Formats a partition with XFS filesystem
mkswap          - Creates a swap area
swapon          - Enables swap space
swapoff         - Disables swap space
wipefs          - Removes filesystem signatures
e2label         - Sets an ext filesystem label
xfs_admin       - Manages XFS filesystem attributes

# Mounting & Unmounting
mount           - Mounts a filesystem
umount          - Unmounts a filesystem
findmnt         - Displays mounted filesystems
mount -a        - Mounts filesystems listed in /etc/fstab
blkid           - Displays filesystem UUIDs
df -hT          - Shows disk usage and filesystem types

# Disk Expansion
growpart        - Expands a partition to fill available disk space
resize2fs       - Expands an ext2/ext3/ext4 filesystem
xfs_growfs      - Expands a mounted XFS filesystem
